WEBVTT

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:00.896
Imam suseda koji poznaje 200 vrsta vina.

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:02.098
On zna sve.

00:14:02.122 --> 00:14:03.907
Zna naziv grožđa, temperaturu i sve.

00:14:03.931 --> 00:14:06.836
Ja poznajem sam dve
vrste vina - crno i belo.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.968
(Smeh)

00:14:08.992 --> 00:14:11.446
Ali moj sused poznaje
samo dve vrste zemalja -

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.197
industrijalizovane i one u razvoju.

00:14:13.221 --> 00:14:14.410
A ja ih poznajem 200.

00:14:14.434 --> 00:14:16.500
Ja poznajem, imam podatke...

00:14:16.524 --> 00:14:17.721
Ali to se može.

00:14:17.745 --> 00:14:22.252
(Aplauz)

00:14:22.276 --> 00:14:23.553
Ali moram da se uozbiljim.

00:14:23.577 --> 00:14:24.784
A kako biti ozbiljan?

00:14:24.808 --> 00:14:26.467
Napravite PowerPoint prezentaciju.

00:14:26.491 --> 00:14:30.689
(Smeh)